<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Laboratory Information System (LIS)</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A high-precision investigative engine that streamlines the diagnostic lifecycle—from 
            test request to clinical validation and automated result delivery.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Order Orchestration & Sample Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate manual transcription errors through closed-loop ordering. Test requests are 
            transmitted instantly from the clinician's dashboard directly to the Laboratory 
            worklist. The system automates sample labeling, generating unique barcodes that 
            ensure every specimen is correctly linked to the patient's identity throughout 
            the investigative process. Laboratory technicians manage their workload 
            through specialized worklists, prioritized by clinical urgency (Stat vs. Routine).
        </p>
        <p>
            Integrated sample collection logs track exactly when specimens were taken and by 
            whom, providing a complete chain-of-custody for every diagnostic event.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Precision Results & Validation</h2>
        <p>
            Standardize your diagnostic output with configurable test profiles and reference 
            ranges. Technicians enter results directly into the system, which automatically 
            flags values falling outside established normal parameters. A multi-stage 
            validation workflow ensures that sensitive results are reviewed by a 
            senior consultant or pathologist before being released to the clinical 
            dashboard, maintaining the highest standards of diagnostic accuracy.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated "Critical Value" alerts bypass the standard workflow, sending immediate 
            notifications to the requesting clinician via SMS or system dashboard 
            whenever life-threatening results are detected.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Diagnostic Analytics & Turnaround Times</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain operational excellence with detailed laboratory performance metrics. Track 
            'Turnaround Time' (TAT) from sample collection to result release, identifying 
            bottlenecks in the investigative process. Analyze test volume trends by 
            department and clinician, informing future equipment procurement and 
            staffing strategies.
        </p>
        <p>
            The system also manages laboratory reagent inventory, tracking consumption 
            levels and upcoming batch expirations, ensuring that diagnostic 
            capabilities are never interrupted by stock-outs.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

